Package: RTutorTeacherGradingBias
Type: Package
Title: RTutor problem set TeacherGradingBias
Version: 0.1
Date: 2026-09-04
Author: Pius Schöler
Maintainer: Pius Schöler, <pius.schoeler@uni-ulm.de>
Description: Provides an interactive problem set that reproduces and explains
    central parts of the empirical analysis in Botelho, Madeira, and Rangel
    (2015), "Racial Discrimination in Grading: Evidence from Brazil"
    <doi:10.1257/app.20140352>. It examines racial differences in
    teacher-assigned mathematics grades in São Paulo public schools using
    descriptive analysis, classroom fixed effects, proxy controls,
    measurement-error simulations, instrumental-variable methods, diagnostic
    tests, and heterogeneity analyses.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: RTutor, haven, dplyr, tibble, ggplot2, lfe, stargazer, fixest, knitr, tidyr
URL: https://github.com/piusschoeler/RTutorTeacherGradingBias
BugReports: https://github.com/piusschoeler/RTutorTeacherGradingBias/issues
